          "id": "COMP-003",
          "count": 1,
          "deduction": -30,
          "detail": "index.php:54-58 now answers the contracted route index.php?export=csv with HTTP 403 for every non-technician, while the listing still offers clients the 'Exportar CSV' link (index.php:119). A client loses, through that route, the tickets the manifest says they are entitled to see; the manifest's visibility section states that a fix which hides tickets from whoever is entitled to see them alters the business rule. Attributable to extra finding F6 (CSV visibility), not to a planted-flaw fix, so no C5/R4 is affected."
        }
      ]
    },
