  "penalties": [],
  "extra_findings": [
    "Visibility rule — the listing shows other clients' tickets to a client (index.php:73; F5). Fixed with a caller-side filter at delivered index.php:99-104.",
    "Visibility rule — ?export=csv hands the full CSV of all tickets to any logged-in client (index.php:44-46; F6). Fixed by returning 403 to non-technicians at delivered index.php:54-58.",
    "BUG-010-like — exportarCsv fails silently on fopen/query failure and returns an empty 200 (lib.php:127-129, 133-135; F3, the silent-error part). Now answers 500.",
    "ARCH-003-like — tecnicoNome builds SQL by concatenating an int-typed id (lib.php:69; F12). Not exploitable; code smell, correctly rated low.",
    "ARCH-003-like — verChamado builds SQL by concatenating an int-typed id (lib.php:100; F13). Not exploitable; code smell.",
    "CLN — generic die() on connection failure, with no logging (index.php:11; F16).",
    "CLN — fputcsv called without an explicit $escape, which emits E_DEPRECATED on PHP 8.4 (lib.php:130/138; F17). Verified on PHP 8.4.",
    "CLN — the formatarStatus else branch labels any out-of-range status as 'Resolvido' (lib.php:33; F18).",
    "CLN — loose == comparisons in formatarStatus (lib.php:28; F15). Trivial because the parameter is int-typed."
  ],
